        {
          "title": "GRP-Obliteration: Unaligning LLMs With a Single Unlabeled Prompt",
          "title_zh": "GRP-Obliteration：用单个无标签提示解除 LLM 对齐",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.06258v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "DeepSeek",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2602.06258",
          "summary": "GRP-Obliteration uses Group Relative Policy Optimization to remove safety constraints from aligned models with a single unlabeled prompt while largely preserving utility, reporting stronger average unalignment than prior techniques. It is evaluated on six utility and five safety benchmarks across fifteen 7–20B models from GPT-OSS, distilled DeepSeek, Gemma, Llama, Ministral and Qwen, and also unaligns diffusion-based image models.",
