        {
          "title": "Is my model \"mind blurting\"? Interpreting the dynamics of reasoning tokens with Recurrence Quantification Analysis (RQA)",
          "title_zh": "我的模型在“走神”吗？用递归量化分析解读推理 token 动态",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.06266v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "DeepSeek",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2602.06266",
          "summary": "The authors treat token generation as a dynamical system, extract hidden embeddings at each step and apply Recurrence Quantification Analysis, using metrics such as determinism and laminarity to capture repetition and stalling. On 3,600 traces from DeepSeek-R1-Distill, the metrics capture signals not reflected by response length and improve task-complexity prediction by 8%.",
          "keywords": [
