        {
          "title": "PhenoLIP: Integrating Phenotype Ontology Knowledge into Medical Vision-Language Pretraining",
          "title_zh": "PhenoLIP：将表型本体知识融入医学视觉-语言预训练",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.06184v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2602.06184",
          "summary": "The authors build PhenoKG, a phenotype-centric multimodal knowledge graph with over 520K image-text pairs linked to more than 3,000 phenotypes, and use it to pretrain PhenoLIP through a knowledge-enhanced phenotype embedding space and teacher-guided distillation. PhenoLIP improves phenotype classification over BiomedCLIP by 8.85% and cross-modal retrieval over BIOMEDICA by 15.03%, with a new expert-verified PhenoBench.",
